<title>POLAND: Swarzedz swings to PLN 30.9 mln loss in Q.</title>
<headline>Swarzedz swings to PLN 30.9 mln loss in Q.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swarzedz SA results for the third quarter ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    Q3 1996	Q3 1995</p>
<p>    operating loss			26.82   vs    4.24 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			  30.83   vs    0.77 profit</p>
<p>    net				     30.94   vs    0.37 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Swarzedzkie Fabryki Mebli SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     26.31   vs   22.60</p>
<p>    costs of sales			26.14   vs   15.85</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.01   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.11   vs    0.40</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.41   vs    0.12</p>
<p>    financial costs			4.42   vs    3.58</p>
<p>JANUARY - SEPTEMBER</p>
<p>    operating loss			23.64   vs    9.22 profit</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			  33.96   vs    2.30 profit</p>
<p>    net				     34.07   vs    0.89 profit</p>
<p>    net sales			     75.70   vs   72.03</p>
<p>    costs of sales			64.01   vs   52.67</p>
<p>    extraordinary			  0.01   vs    0.04 loss</p>
<p>    income tax			     0.11   vs    1.41</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.62   vs    0.70</p>
<p>    financial costs		     10.95   vs    7.59</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
